## Suggested CI checks the agent should add
- `openssl x509 -noout -text -in cert.pem` to ensure SANs and expiry are present.
- `openssl verify -CAfile ca-chain.pem cert.pem` to validate chains.
- `bash` script to assert key length and type (RSA size or EC curve).
- Secrets scanning to detect private keys accidentally committed.

